docs {
  # AttendanceService.CloseDay

  Absent for whoever has no mark yet (one section, or every section)

  `/ltedu.attendance.v1.AttendanceService/CloseDay` · unary · `ltedu/attendance/v1/attendance.proto`

  ## Request — `CloseDayRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `day` | `string` |  |
  | `section_id` | `string` | Empty: every section of the day (office only) |

  ## Response — `CloseDayResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `marked` | `int32` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
